The '''level progression''' described here is the advancement of a [[player character]] based solely on [[character level]], which has a prerequisite number of [[experience point]]s (XP). This advancement includes [[ability]] increases, additional [[general feat]]s, and the maximum [[skill rank]]s, with a lower upper limit for [[cross-class skill]]s.
This does not include [[bonus feat]]s, as those depend on factors other than character level.

